WEBVTT

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:04.600
Organizations face countless cybersecurity recommendations, standards, frameworks,

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:05.500
and best practices.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:08.000
That volume can make it difficult to decide where to start.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.350
The CIS Controls were developed to help organizations focus on a prioritized set of

00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:15.500
defensive actions that reduce risk and improve security outcomes.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:17.435
Rather than trying to do everything at once,

00:00:17.435 --> 00:00:22.000
the controls help organizations concentrate on activities that provide meaningful value.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.720
For engineers, administrators, managers, and security professionals,

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:29.980
the CIS Controls create a practical language for turning security goals into operational

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:30.500
work.
